So it's like taking a bunch of Legos and
rebuilding a completely different shape.

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:25.710
So the C double bond O can
move from carbon number one to

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.590
carbon number two as a result.

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.370
So when it moves from one to the other.

00:01:29.734 --> 00:01:34.785
It makes this oxidation possible
