00:06:02.235 --> 00:06:03.945
And that's the idea of
oxidation reduction.

00:06:04.345 --> 00:06:06.185
Is this all that's possible in your body?

00:06:06.235 --> 00:06:08.034
Well, your body is a complex place.

00:06:08.245 --> 00:06:10.855
There's all kinds of other
