00:06:28.485 --> 00:06:32.555
So if you have a strong oxidation, what
this is going to do, it's going to oxidize

00:06:32.855 --> 00:06:34.975
two different points on your molecule.

00:06:34.985 --> 00:06:41.165
The first place it's going to oxidize
